Subject: [PATCH 12/16] Settings: Fix up panel theme and layout

* Ref: https://github.com/omnirom/android_packages_apps_Settings/commit/1f7b774ff240f3b5f5c8087d3a259a9bb31fd0aa
* The reference commit is incomplete.

